<title>USA: NYSE halts trading in Centennial for day.</title>
<headline>NYSE halts trading in Centennial for day.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange on Tuesday said trading in Centennial Technologies Inc stock would not resume for the remainder of the day.</p>
<p>The exchange halted the stock earlier Tuesday for an imbalance. The last sale was at 14-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
